secubox-jellyfin (2.0.1-1~bookworm1) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * jellyfinctl: fix `partner wire` crash (unbound $name in single-line local under
    set -u); guard all positionals + safe empty-array expansion.
  * partner auto-wire: peertube is now a real Jellyfin library (movies,
    /data/peertube/storage/videos) instead of link-only.
  * install-lxc: automate the Jellyfin first-run wizard (Startup API -> admin
    user + API key in /etc/secubox/secrets), so the API leaves 503 and partner
    wiring works out of the box. Idempotent (.wizard-done sentinel), non-fatal.

